            "sid": "LEV 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa ndaŵi jimkugowola yindu m'migunda mwenu, mkasimgowola mpaka mungulugulu malile, soni mkasimwujila kuja kulokotanya yakusigalila mu mgunda mli m'masile kugowola. Yeleyi mwalecele ŵandu ŵakulaga ni acalendo kuti alokotanye. Une ndili AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
